# CTL-SIDES -- W4-AM-04: an Allied mission, Abort, then a Soviet mission in the
# SAME process: the second sidebar must be the Soviet art (the texture cache
# used to keep the first side's "sb:*" textures). Check the shots by eye:
# side_allied.png (blue eagle) / side_soviet.png (red hammer and sickle).
set render_every 0
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button "New Campaign"
click well:allied
click button Load
until 30 scene == campaign-load
until 300 scene == game
wait 5
shot side_allied
key esc
wait 2
click "menu:ABORT MISSION"
wait 2
if confirm_open == 1 then click confirm:yes
until 60 scene == "shell:Main Menu"
click button "Single Player"
click button "New Campaign"
click well:soviet
click button Load
until 30 scene == campaign-load
until 300 scene == game
wait 5
shot side_soviet
assert mode == campaign
end
